  "title": "Anthropic Researcher Says AI Has Over a 10% Chance of Killing All Humans",
  "slug": "anthropic-researcher-says-ai-has-over-a-10-chance-of-killing-all-humans",
  "canonicalUrl": "https://aidailybrief.ai/e/2026-09-10",
  "dek": "A researcher's resignation post from Anthropic and a colleague's greater-than-10% doom odds racked up 200 million views and wall-to-wall mainstream coverage in a day. The warnings aren't new — so NLW spends the episode on what actually changed: the politics, the priming, the media economics, and where a less outraged conversation could go from here.",
  "durationMin": 36,
